{"metadata":{"title":"IvorMIDI2","roleHeading":"Framework","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"symbolKind":"module","externalID":"IvorMIDI2","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"IvorMIDI2"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The IvorMIDI2 framework provides "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/midi.org\/universal-midi-packet-ump-and-midi-2-0-protocol-specification","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"support written in Swift, building on the message and data value types of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/eBardX\/IvorMIDI","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". A UMP group number addresses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one of the 16 groups of a packet stream, and a UMP packet holds the one to four"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"32-bit words that its message type requires. The channel and system messages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of IvorMIDI can be converted to and from MIDI 1.0 Universal MIDI Packets, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CoreMIDI’s event lists carry them: channel voice messages as single-word"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"packets of message type 0x2, system common and real-time messages as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single-word packets of message type 0x1, and system exclusive messages as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two-word packets of message type 0x3. The MIDI 2.0 message families have types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of their own: utility messages, MIDI 2.0 channel voice messages, System"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Exclusive 8 messages, Flex Data messages, and UMP stream messages. A message"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader turns a stream of 32-bit words into messages of every family,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reassembling those that span several packets."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import IvorMIDI","import IvorMIDI2","","\/\/ Middle C, velocity 127, on channel 1 of group 6.","let noteOn = MIDIChannelMessage.noteOn(1, 60, 127)","let packet = noteOn.packet(group: 6)               \/\/ words: [0x25903C7F]","","\/\/ Decode the message and its group from a packet.","if let received = MIDI2Packet(words: [0x25903c7f]) {","    MIDIChannelMessage(packet: received) == noteOn \/\/ true","    received.group                                 \/\/ 6","}","","\/\/ A system exclusive message spans one two-word packet per 6 data bytes.","let sysEx = MIDISystemMessage.systemExclusive([0x7e, 0x7f, 0x09, 0x01, 0xf7])","let packets = sysEx.packets()                      \/\/ words: [0x30047E7F, 0x09010000]","","\/\/ Read the messages of a stream of words, in any grouping.","var reader = MIDI2MessageReader()","","reader.read(words: [0x45903c00])                   \/\/ []: half a packet","reader.read(words: [0xffff0000])                   \/\/ [.midi2ChannelVoice(.noteOn(1, 60, 65535, nil), 6)]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/UsingIvorMIDI2","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for a full guide to packets, groups, the message"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"families, and reading a stream."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormidi2"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Universal MIDI Packet (UMP) group and message encoding types.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/UsingIvorMIDI2"],"anchor":"Guides"},{"title":"Data values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2Group"],"anchor":"Data-values"},{"title":"Reading messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2Message","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2MessageReader"],"anchor":"Reading-messages"},{"title":"Packets","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2Packet","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2PacketsConvertible","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible"],"anchor":"Packets"},{"title":"Utility messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2UtilityMessage"],"anchor":"Utility-messages"},{"title":"MIDI 2.0 channel voice messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2ChannelMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2NoteAttribute"],"anchor":"MIDI-20-channel-voice-messages"},{"title":"System Exclusive 8 messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message"],"anchor":"System-Exclusive-8-messages"},{"title":"Flex Data messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2FlexDataMessage"],"anchor":"Flex-Data-messages"},{"title":"UMP stream messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2StreamMessage"],"anchor":"UMP-stream-messages"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2ChannelMessage":{"role":"symbol","title":"MIDI2ChannelMessage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MIDI 2.0 channel voice message (message type 0x4)."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2ChannelMessage"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2ChannelMessage","url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2channelmessage","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2ChannelMessage"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2NoteAttribute":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MIDI2NoteAttribute","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2noteattribute","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An attribute of a MIDI 2.0 note on or note off message: an attribute type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with 16 bits of attribute data."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2NoteAttribute","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MIDI2NoteAttribute","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MIDI2NoteAttribute","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that can be converted to and from the Universal MIDI Packets that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encode it without a group."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2GrouplessPacketsConvertible"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2grouplesspacketsconvertible"},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/UsingIvorMIDI2":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/usingivormidi2","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Carry MIDI 1.0 and MIDI 2.0 messages in Universal MIDI Packets, and read them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"back from a stream of words."}],"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/UsingIvorMIDI2","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Using IvorMIDI2"},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2StreamMessage":{"role":"symbol","title":"MIDI2StreamMessage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A UMP stream message (message type 0xF), addressed to a UMP endpoint as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whole."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2StreamMessage"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2StreamMessage","url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2streammessage","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MIDI2StreamMessage","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2Group":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2Group"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Universal MIDI Packet (UMP) group number (1–16)."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2Group"}],"title":"MIDI2Group","url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2group","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2Group"},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2Message":{"abstract":[{"text":"A message of any kind that travels in Universal MIDI Packets.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2Message"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2message","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2Message","role":"symbol","title":"MIDI2Message","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2Message"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A System Exclusive 8 message (message type 0x5): system exclusive data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose bytes may use all 8 bits."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2SystemExclusive8Message"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2systemexclusive8message"},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2UtilityMessage":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2UtilityMessage"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2utilitymessage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Universal MIDI Packet utility message (message type 0x0)."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2UtilityMessage","title":"MIDI2UtilityMessage","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2UtilityMessage"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2PacketsConvertible":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2PacketsConvertible"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2packetsconvertible","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that can be converted to and from the Universal MIDI Packets that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encode it in a group."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI2\/documentation\/IvorMIDI2\/MIDI2PacketsConvertible","title":"MIDI2PacketsConvertible","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2PacketsConvertible"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI2/documentation/IvorMIDI2/MIDI2MessageReader":{"abstract":[{"text":"A reader of the messages in a stream of Universal MIDI Packets.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDI2MessageReader"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi2\/midi2messa